                'language_id' => '7',
            ],
            [
                'text' => '<p>ロサンゼルスでは、ワクチンの接種が進んでいます。 COVID-19の感染数が減少し続けるにつれて、通常の生活へと回復に向かっています。したがって、2021年5月10日以降、MLIではWestwood校で多数の対面プログラムを再開致します。<br /><br />また、MLIハリウッド校に関しては通知があるまでは、引き続きプログラムはオンラインでの提供となります。<br /><br />プログラムスケジュールの詳細は下記のリンクよりご確認下さい。</p><br /><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f0cf0;"><strong>&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Westwood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;プログラムスケジュール（ウエストウッド）</a> &nbsp;&rarr;&nbsp; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Hollywood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;プログラムスケジュール（ハリウッド）</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f0cf0;"><strong>&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/jp/faq-covid19">&nbsp;よくある質問</a> &rarr; &nbsp;<a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/jp/safety-covid19">&nbsp;MLIの感染予防対策</a></strong></span></div>',
                'language_id' => '8',
            ],
            [
                'text' => '<p>As vacinas est&atilde;o sendo administradas com sucesso em um ritmo acelerado em Los Angeles. Como os n&uacute;meros do COVID-19 continuam diminuindo, poderemos come&ccedil;ar a tomar medidas para retomar nossas vidas normais. Portanto, a partir de 10/Maio/2021, MLI adicionar&aacute; mais&nbsp;<strong>programas presenciais</strong>&nbsp;no campus de Westwood.<br /><br />Veja a programa&ccedil;&atilde;o para detalhes.<br /><br />Isso tamb&eacute;m significa que os&nbsp;<strong>programas presenciais</strong>&nbsp;da MLI Hollywood continuar&atilde;o a ser realizados on-line at&eacute; novo aviso.</p><br /><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f0cf0;"><strong>&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Westwood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;Cronograma de programa (Westwood)</a> &rarr; &nbsp;<a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Hollywood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;Cronograma de programa (Hollywood)</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f0cf0;"><strong>&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/por/faq-covid19">&nbsp;FAQ COVID-19</a> &rarr; &nbsp;<a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/por/safety-covid19">&nbsp;MLI COVID-19 Safety Measures</a></strong></span></div>',
                'language_id' => '9',
            ],
            [
                'text' => '<p>在洛杉矶，疫苗的接种成功率很高。随着COVID-19感染人数继续减少，我们将能够开始采取措施恢复正常生活。因此，从2021年5月10日开始，MLI将在Westwood校园增加更多的面对面课程。<br /><br />这也意味着，面对面的MLI Hollywood课程将继续线上进行，直到另行通知。<br /><br />有关详细信息，请参见时间表。</p><br /><div style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: #0f0cf0;">&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Westwood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;课程表（Westwood）</a> &rarr; &nbsp;<a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Hollywood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;课程表（好莱坞）</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></strong></div><div style="text-align: center;"><strong><span style="color: #0f0cf0;">&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/ch/faq-covid19">&nbsp;常见问题COVID-19</a> &nbsp;&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/ch/safety-covid19">&nbsp;MLI COVID-19安全措施</a></span></strong></div>',
                'language_id' => '10',
            ],
            [
                'text' => '<p>I vaccini vengono somministrati con successo a un ritmo accelerato a Los Angeles. Poich&eacute; i numeri di COVID-19 continuano a diminuire, saremo in grado di iniziare a prendere provvedimenti per riprendere le nostre vite normali. Pertanto, a partire dal 5/10/2021, MLI aggiunger&agrave; altri programmi di persona al Westwood Campus.<br /><br />Ci&ograve; significa anche che i programmi MLI Hollywood di persona continueranno a essere tenuti online fino a nuovo avviso.<br /><br />Vedere il programma per i dettagli.</p><br /><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f0cf0;"><strong>&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Westwood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;Programma del programma (Westwood)</a> &rarr; &nbsp;<a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/documents/Class-Schedule-Hollywood.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">&nbsp;Programma (Hollywood)</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></div><div style="text-align: center;"><span style="color: #0f0cf0;"><strong>&rarr; <a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/it/faq-covid19">&nbsp;FAQ COVID-19</a> &rarr; &nbsp;<a style="color: #0f0cf0;" href="/it/safety-covid19">&nbsp;MLI COVID-19 Misure di sicurezza</a></strong></span></div>',
                'language_id' => '11',
            ],
            [
